# Virtual environment
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
src/**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store

# Data
# The raw, cleaned and merged tables are large and reproducible from the
# pipeline, so they stay out of git. The one exception is the collapsed station
# table: the deployed dashboard needs it and cannot rebuild it without the
# 81 MB epa-full.csv that this rule excludes. Note the pattern must be `data/*`
# rather than `data/`, because git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is itself excluded.
data/*
!data/stations.csv

# Claude files
CLAUDE.md

# Saved models
# Tracked, not ignored — the app loads them at startup and cannot train on the
# host. They total ~165 MB (largest single file 17 MB), which fits inside
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit without LFS. Keep them that way: this was
# 1.9 GB before the random forests were given a leaf floor, and at that size
# the deploy failed both on push and on the host's 512 MB of RAM.

# EDA outputs
/src/04_eda/outputs/
/src/04_eda/plots/